      "description": {
        "en": "draw.io diagrams inline in the chat: the agent creates the diagram, an interactive draw.io viewer renders right in the transcript, and the agent can later read, edit and undo changes to the same .drawio file. No draw.io account, no npx MCP server, no local editor install. The right sidebar previews .drawio files instead of showing raw XML.",
        "zh": "聊天内联的 draw.io 图表：模型创建图表，聊天里直接出现可交互的 draw.io 视图，之后还能读取、改图和撤销同一个 .drawio 文件。不登录 draw.io、不需要 npx MCP server、不用装本地编辑器。右侧栏可直接预览 .drawio（不再是 XML 文本）。"
      },
